  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "costa-rica-mother-nature-s-gifts",
      "title": "Costa Rica: Mother Nature's Gifts",
      "subtitle": "",
      "image": {
        "src": "images/costa-rica-mother-nature-s-gifts-a-jungle-beach-wellness-journey/JPwVldZ7QSaAtLj4QMMQ.webp",
        "x": 50,
        "y": 50
      },
      "html": "<p><strong>Costa Rica invites you to slow down and experience nature with all your senses. Mother Nature’s Gifts is a nine-day journey for adults that moves from the Central Pacific coast to the wild landscapes of the Osa Peninsula, bringing together adventure, rest, creativity, and connection.</strong></p><p><strong>You’ll explore rivers and waterfalls, walk through tropical forest, spend time by the sea, and take part in experiences ranging from yoga and sound healing to art, movement, and Costa Rican cooking. Shared meals and guided activities create opportunities to connect, while open time lets you follow your own pace. Come ready to explore, unwind, and enjoy the simple pleasure of being somewhere extraordinary.</strong></p>",
      "gallery": []
    },
    {
