        "y": 50
      },
      "html": "<p><strong>Welcome to Costa Rica! </strong>Arrive in San José and transfer to your accommodations, where you can settle in after your journey. <strong>Gather for welcome cocktails </strong>and meet your fellow travelers before enjoying a free evening. Rest, explore nearby at your own pace, or simply take a moment to let the trip begin.</p>",
