      "html": "<p><strong>Travel to Playa Hermosa</strong> on Costa Rica’s Central Pacific coast. At <strong>Jaguara</strong>, a dedicated healing space, take part in a <strong>guided temazcal</strong>, or sweat lodge, ceremony designed as a moment to pause and set intentions for the days ahead. Afterward, enjoy free time at the beach before coming together for dinner.</p>",
