        "y": 50
      },
      "html": "<p>Begin with morning yoga, then join a guided hike in <strong>Manuel Antonio National Park</strong> to experience its tropical forest and coastal scenery. At sunset, take part in a <strong>cacao experience</strong>. Later, prepare a meal together in a plant-based cooking class inspired by Costa Rica’s tropical ingredients.</p>",
