      },
      "html": "<p>Take a boat excursion to <strong>Caño Island Biological Reserve</strong> for a marine and nature experience in the waters off Costa Rica’s southern coast. After the excursion, travel back to San José for your final evening together. Share dinner and reflect on the places, experiences, and connections that made the journey your own.</p>",
